speechtext:
Reports of the auditor general on unemployment relief expenditures are made to the Minister of Finance who transmits a copy to the Department of Labour. In addition to reports tabled in the House of Commons, the following reports were received:
Expenditures on relief works, city of Montreal, 1930 and 1931 acts-report dated July 6, 1934;
Provincial accounts for relief works and direct relief, 1930 act-report dated December 11, 1934.
